      <title>WHAT PHRASE WOULD YOU DELETE!? 😡 | FT. PRAS | FPL 25/26 | GW17</title>
      <description><![CDATA[Nick, Ash and Pras are back for FPL Gameweek 17 and it DESCENDS into chaos 🔥

1-Minute FPL Teams ⏱️
The Thermo-Meter heats up (Rogers, Calvert-Lewin & Palmer) 🌡️
December Legends League MOTM is decided 🏆
Plus Fesshole: Secret Santa delivers 🎁

Then things get HEATED 😳
👉 Just One Question: What phrase should be deleted from existence forever?

⚠️ Strong opinions. Zero filter.

Drop your answer in the comments 👇

⭐ MEMBERS VIDEO
Tuesday Social: Menzies vs Table 😡 | Times you completely lost it

