    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">f031ac1d-404f-445a-bf32-fcf63168e9de</guid>
      <title>NORTH LONDON FOREVER! EPiC or CRiNGE? 😅 | FT. FPL MARCELLO | FPL 25/26 | GW13</title>
      <description><![CDATA[This one is going to be absolute CHAOS 🤯🔥 Strap in, grab a drink 🍺, and get involved in the chat 💬 because tonight we’re diving head-first into one of the most controversial football questions of the season: Is ‘North London Forever’ an iconic anthem… or is it pure, undiluted cringe? 😅🎶 Nick, Ash, and special guest FPL Marcello are in the studio 🎥 

But that’s not all — this GW13 stream is PACKED 📦🔥:
06:14 🔥 1-Minute FPL Teams – The boys reveal their squads at breakneck speed ⚡ and defend the indefensible 😭.
28:00 🔥 Thermo-Meter – Eze, Minteh & Roger’s… who’s on 🔥 and who’s straight into the ❄️ freezer?
47:49 🔥 Legends League – November Player of the Month 🏆, overall standings 📊, and who’s quietly cooking 🍳.
50:53 🔥 Tuesday Social – North London Forever debate: anthem 🎵 or embarrassment?

Plus, we’ve got a Members-Only Christmas Films🎄🎬 Special dropping right after the show! 🎁
Don’t just watch — be part of the show. Let’s go! 🔴🔥🚀

Follow Marcello:
X - https://x.com/FPL_Marcello?s=20

FPL Addicts:
Youtube - https://youtube.com/@fpladdicts?si=AuXKJI2btWhTYDyt

