      <description><![CDATA[It might be the International Break… but the FPL drama NEVER stops! 😤

Nick, Ash, Alf & Rupert are back for a wild one:
🔍 12:22 Team Reviews – Who’s flying, who’s flopping? 
⚽ 26:12 Tuesday Social – Official FPL one too far with the banter? 
⚖️ 45:10 VAR Courtroom – was VVD's goal rightfully ruled out for offside? 
🏆 1:01:29 Legends League (SFS) – which of our Legends is leading the way!? 

Hit 👍 if you love FPL, drop a comment to join the chat, and make sure you’re SUBSCRIBED and turn notification ON so you don’t miss the next one!

