      <title>SOMETHiNG YOU SECRETLY HATE!? | FT. GARY FPL PUBCAST | FPL 25/26 | GW11</title>
      <description><![CDATA[🔥 Tonight on FPL JUiCE! 🔥 We’re back with another packed episode full of laughs, banter, and FPL chaos!

👉03:34 1 Minute FPL Teams – Nick, Ash, and Gary reveal their latest teams in rapid-fire style. Who’s bottled it and who’s flying?
🔥 22:04  Thermo-Meter – We’re turning up the heat on Rice, Cherki, and Minteh — are they 🔥 hot picks or ❄️ stone cold flops?
🏆42:26  Legends League – We crown the October MOTM, reveal the November contenders, and check the overall leaderboard.
💬 46:08 Fesshole – One wild confession that’ll have you questioning humanity (again).
🎭 1:01:34 Just One Question – “What’s something you pretend to like but secretly hate?” Expect brutal honesty and some wild answers!

💡 Subscribe, join the chat, and drop your own FPL takes live — it’s the show where FPL meets pure entertainment!

