      <title>WHAT’S YOUR MOST UNPOPULAR FPL OPiNiON? | FPL 25/26 | GAMEWEEK 9</title>
      <description><![CDATA[Join us for another jam-packed episode of FPL JUiCE where we ask you lot, what your most unpopular FPL opinion is!!! 🔥 The boys are back with another wild week of FPL takes, chaos and pure entertainment! 😎 We’ve got all the big talking points ahead of Gameweek 9, plus a few confessions to unwrap and digest!

01:03 ⚽ FPL Teams - Talking about our teams in less than 60 seconds!
11:43 🌶 Thermo-Meter - Ranking the spiciness of Eli Kroupi, Mateta, Welbeck and Mbeumo!
29:46 ⭐ Legends League - Checking out the latest rankings in our prize league!
32:56 🤣 Fesshole - Casting judgement on a Halloween confession and a naughty one from Gianni Buttice!
51:43 🗣 Tuesday Social - Reading out your most unpopular FPL opinions!

👇 Drop your most unpopular FPL takes in the comments!

