      <title>📺 Pre-Season 4 | FPL 25/26 | Ft. Az and Yelena!!🔥</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>We’re back with another JUICY episode of FPL JUiCE – and this week we’re joined by two fantasy football legends: Az and Yelena! 🧪 Thermo-Meter returns as we rank new signings Gyokeres, Wirtz, Ekitike, Mbeumo, Cunha, and Joao Pedro – who’s hot and who’s not? 📋 We dive into Team Reveals from our special guests, dissecting pre-season picks, bold differentials, and must-haves. ⚔️ In Legends League (SFS), the race heats up – who’s smashing it and who’s slipping? And in Extra Time: 🎧 Tuesday Social tackles Spotify ID verification – protection or overreach? 💔 Agony Can’t answers your dilemmas with zero grace. 🤖 “Just One Question”: Is owning an AI sex-bot cheating? 🔥 Ash v Nick battle it out in another head-to-head showdown! 👉 Like, comment, and subscribe for more FPL chaos, banter, and bold predictions every week. #FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLJUiCE #AshvNick #TeamReveals #FPLPreseason #Az #Yelena #NewSignings #LegendsLeague #SpotifyNews #AI #CheatingDebate 💬 If you're into FPL and chaos in equal measure, this is your pod. Hit play, hit like, and hit up the socials: @FPL_Juice on Twitter, Insta, and TikTok. #FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLJuice #FPLPlonker #PreSeason #FPLNews #FPLDraft #LegendsLeague #Gyokeres #FPL25_26</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
