      <description><![CDATA[<p>The <i>FPL Juice</i> boys are back, and the juice is flowing! 🍹</p><p>Ash and Nick are joined by FPL royalty this week: the Benfleet bossman himself <strong>FPL Blanca</strong>, and <strong>Ed</strong> from <strong>Fantasy Football Scout</strong> and <strong>Fantasy Football Fest</strong>. Expect chaos, clashing opinions, and <i>shockingly</i> useful FPL advice.</p><p>🔥 Topics covered:</p><p>Arsenal's new £9m man: <strong>Viktor Gyökeres</strong> – bargain or bust?</p><p>Salah vs Haaland vs... no premium? Early wildcard chat.</p><p>Bench Boost in GW1: genius or madness?</p><p>Goalkeeper strategy for 25/26: Pickford, Kelleher, or spin the wheel?</p><p>Most-owned player traps: Are you being baited?</p><p>Defenders who <i>actually</i> contribute – welcome to the age of BPS metrics.</p><p>PLUS:</p><p>Ash’s drill rap is back</p><p>“Which five liquids would you want from your fingers?” 🤯</p><p>The latest Legends League prizes and how to win a <strong>signed shirt every month</strong></p><p>A whole load of savage banter</p><p>💬 If you're into FPL and chaos in equal measure, <strong>this is your pod</strong>. Hit play, hit like, and hit up the socials:<br /><strong>@FPL_Juice</strong> on Twitter, Insta, and TikTok.</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
