    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">cf5ff18f-f2ad-42e4-833e-2b1759576476</guid>
      <title>FPL Pre-Season 2 | FPL 25/26 | Ft. @Beyondthesidelines</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>🎙️ FPL JUiCE is back for Pre-Season 2 of the 25/26 campaign – and it’s absolute mayhem. We’re joined by the brilliant minds from Beyond the Sidelines as we tear into all the new FPL chaos: position swaps, chip changes, AFCON curveballs, and a BPS shake-up that’s already ruining drafts. Nick, Ash, Corrie and Pilot reveal their early teams (some better than others...), the Legends League starts swinging, and of course – Ash v Nick returns with more fire than logic. And over in Extra Time (members only)? We’re debating Coldplay concerts, food TV firings, friendship dynamics, and reading out agony letters we absolutely shouldn’t be trusted with. 🔥 It’s nonsense, it’s unfiltered, it’s essential. Join the madness. Hit like, subscribe, and become a member for just 99p to unlock the full Extra Time chaos. #FPLJUiCE #FPL2526 #AshVsNick #BeyondTheSidelines #FantasyPremierLeague #FPL</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
