    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">efda3d56-884c-4504-af1b-7a1d2e50cb24</guid>
      <title>🚨 FPL Launch Day is (almost) here… but WE are READY! 🚨 Featuring @TrophyFPL</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>🚨 FPL Launch Day is (almost) here… but WE are READY! 🚨 Join us LIVE from 6:30pm for the official FPL Launch Day Special – even if the game’s not quite ready, we’re bringing the banter, bold predictions, and brilliant guests to kick off the season in style! 🔥 We're joined by the one and only Mo (Trophy FPL) for a deep dive into all things Fantasy Premier League – plus a breakdown of the early YouTube analytics for FPL creators: 📈 Which channels are blowing up? 🧠 What trends are shaping the pre-season? 💰 How can YOU grow your FPL content in 2025? 🆕 NEW FORMAT ALERT! From 7pm, we go EXCLUSIVE in the JUiCE Members Zone – for the first time ever, we're switching straight into MEMBERS ONLY MODE. All for just 99p/month! 💸 Become a Member now and don’t miss a minute 👉 https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3OZ_37l-WOMjW_K6I0ZbTw/join 📅 Set your reminders. 💬 Jump in the live chat. 🎯 It’s FPL season – and we’re just getting started. #FPLLaunch #FPL2025 #FPLYouTube #FPLJUiCE #FantasyPremierLeague #TrophyFPL #FPLContentCreators 👕 Check out Signed Football Shirts: (Use Promo Code Juice20 for 20% off) https://linktr.ee/Signedfshirts 🧡 Become a Channel Member: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3OZ_37l-WOMjW_K6I0ZbTw/join ⭐ Get Merch & Follow Us Everywhere: https://linktr.ee/thefpljuiceshow #FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLCommunity #FPLTips #Gameweek #FantasyFootball #FPLCartel #FPLNews #FPLShow #FPLStrategy</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Jul 2025 19:42:17 +0000</pubDate>
