    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">d9968375-4af7-4d12-86db-8129d41f61e9</guid>
      <title>Gameweek 38 | FPL 24/25 | Ash vs Nick Draft Special!</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Nick and Ash won’t let the end of the Premier League stop the arguing, so we’re turning it into something useful. Tonight they draft two 11-a-side squads that will face off on 7 June at Barnet FC to raise money for Street Child United. YOU CAN STILL SIGN UP TO THE DRAFT! https://forms.gle/EBEH1oLGtXCc5hL1A What’s happening tonight? Snake-style draft, live. Once a player’s name is called, they’re locked in. The pool: Some Titan FPL creators, a couple of viewers who claim they’re “decent on the wing,” and a couple of ringers who can actually play. Your chat-spam is fair game. Roast their picks, pitch your own, maybe even sway a choice. Why it matters - Every donation goes straight to Street Child United, helping kids living on the streets get safety, education, and a shot at a better life. We’re aiming high, so if you enjoy any part of this circus, drop a few quid. 👉 Donate: https://www.justgiving.com/campaign/nick-vs-ash-charity-match Key dates Draft Night: now, obviously. Match Day: Saturday 7 June, kick-off 13:00 BST, The Hive Stadium, Barnet FC. How you can get involved? Hit the donation link above. Even £2 makes a difference. Smash Like and Subscribe so YouTube actually shows this to other football nerds. Share the stream on Twitter/X, Insta, or send it to that mate who still thinks he can play centre-back after six pints. Monetisation from this stream and ad revenue will also be added to the JustGiving pot. No fluff, no corporate spin, just a kick-about for a good cause. @launchpodstudios are covering all costs with a little help from @FFScout_ Get involved in the live chat, share your thoughts, and join the chaos! 🚀 Smash that LIKE, hit SUBSCRIBE, and ring the BELL ICON to never miss an episode. 👀 Let us know your favourite parts of the show in the comments! Follow Nima: X - https://x.com/FPLNima 👕 Check out Signed Football Shirts: (Use Promo Code Juice20 for 20% off) https://linktr.ee/Signedfshirts 🚀 💰 Support rising FPL creators through our Content Creator Fund: https://fpljuice.com/contentfund 🧡 Become a Channel Member: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3OZ_37l-WOMjW_K6I0ZbTw/join ⭐ Get Merch & Follow Us Everywhere: https://linktr.ee/thefpljuiceshow #FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLCommunity #FPLTips #Gameweek #FantasyFootball #FPLCartel #FPLNews #FPLShow #FPLStrategy</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 20 May 2025 19:17:15 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>edit@launchpodstudios.com (FPL JUiCE)</author>
      <link>http://www.fpljuice.com</link>
