tors through our Content Creator Fund: https://fpljuice.com/contentfund 🧡 Become a Channel Member: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3OZ_37l-WOMjW_K6I0ZbTw/join ⭐ Get Merch & Follow Us Everywhere: https://linktr.ee/thefpljuiceshow #FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLCommunity #FPLTips #Gameweek #FantasyFootball #FPLCartel #FPLNews #FPLShow #FPLStrategy</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></content:encoded>
      <enclosure length="81733449" type="audio/mpeg" url="https://injector.simplecastaudio.com/959b8d3c-120d-49c3-8fae-43559d1fe8b5/episodes/0ffad1b6-d4c7-4188-9f46-d5ede6be5dc8/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&amp;awCollectionId=959b8d3c-120d-49c3-8fae-43559d1fe8b5&amp;awEpisodeId=0ffad1b6-d4c7-4188-9f46-d5ede6be5dc8&amp;feed=7rHIPLtQ"/>
