    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">12fa30cb-e172-46f7-aaa9-b11e27c12c62</guid>
      <title>Gameweek 37 | FPL 24/25 | Ft. FPLNima</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>In this week's action-packed episode: 16:56 ⚽ Team Reveals & Reviews – Dive into the squads of Ash, Nick and Nima as we discuss the highs, lows, and big decisions! 44:08 🏆 Legends League Update – Who's won Manager of the Month? And how are those Overall rankings! 49:57 ⚖ VAR Courtroom - Do you agree with the final verdict on these controversial refereeing decisions? 1:06:01 ⚽ Top, Top 3 Poll – The boys Build-aPlayer and you guys vote on who’s baller is best! 1:29:12 ⌚ Guess The Player – FPL ball knowledge is put to the test in this high-stakes pressure chamber! 1:33:19 🔊 Tuesday Social - Getting chatty with some off-FPL topics! 📊 Poll Results – Your votes are in! Did your favourite win? Get involved in the live chat, share your thoughts, and join the chaos! 🚀 Smash that LIKE, hit SUBSCRIBE, and ring the BELL ICON to never miss an episode. 👀 Let us know your favourite parts of the show in the comments! Follow Nima: X - https://x.com/FPLNima 👕 Check out Signed Football Shirts: (Use Promo Code Juice20 for 20% off) https://linktr.ee/Signedfshirts 🚀 💰 Support rising FPL creators through our Content Creator Fund: https://fpljuice.com/contentfund 🧡 Become a Channel Member: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3OZ_37l-WOMjW_K6I0ZbTw/join ⭐ Get Merch & Follow Us Everywhere: https://linktr.ee/thefpljuiceshow #FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #FPLCommunity #FPLTips #Gameweek #FantasyFootball #FPLCartel #FPLNews #FPLShow #FPLStrategy</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 15 May 2025 13:43:17 +0000</pubDate>
