    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">d6999218-a4ca-4d5d-a326-de3b363708cc</guid>
      <title>Gameweek 10 | FPL spooktacular 24/25 | Ft. @FPLBlackBox &amp; @YelenaFPL</title>
      <description><![CDATA[It’s been a spine-chilling season of horror shows for Nick so far, so let’s give him a rare moment in the sunlight—before the shadows return—as he revels in his ghostly good Mbeumo captaincy call! We’ll dive into the haunted highs and ghoulish lows of Gameweek 9, each moment creeping upon us like an unwanted specter, before we cast our spectral gaze upon the most fearsome forward options for Gameweek 10 and beyond. We’ll crown our Manager of the Month for October under the eerie glow of moonlight, administer grim scrutiny in the VAR Courtroom, and plunge into a spooky, Halloween-themed Room 101. And for you lucky souls in our haunted audience, there’s even a blood-curdling quiz—trick or treat at your own risk!

⚽ Register for the JUiCE 5-a-Side Winter Tournament
https://www.fpljuice.com/winter-tournament

