      <title>Gameweek 9 - THE FPL CARTEL EXPOSED</title>
      <description><![CDATA[GW8 is over and the robot is still malfunctioning! There were red cards, contentious goals and penalties and as always, Wood had the final say! Join Nick, Ash and Adam as we discuss all the fallout from these weekend’s round of fixtures and plan for the upcoming gameweek. Just don’t mention ‘The Cartel’ 🕴️ Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See https://pcm.adswizz.com
for information about our collection and use of personal data for
advertising.
]]></description>
