      <title>GW8 feat FPL Graduates</title>
      <description><![CDATA[FPL is back but we never left! With Ash in the top 50k in the world we actually provide important knowledgeable insight so you will now improve your rank (not likely). We get back in the groove with our teams and rate some spicy options too. We welcome back favourites Room 101 and Tuesday Social whilst a special segment makes its long-awaited return! All this with Ben from the Grads. Shuffle T couldnt make it. Or he watched the show and thought f that 😭


