    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">ec173d7b-7a43-44d4-9447-a926b2accd16</guid>
      <title>FPL GW7 - Leaks, Tweaks and Winning Gameweeks featuring @FPLHarry</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Did your Wildcard fail? Are you as bad at FPL as your favourite content creator? Then you’re in the right place! We take you through just how bad our Gameweek 6 teams did and reveal our plans for GW7! There’s 4 more players to rate for the short-term and we crown our Manager of the Month for September! There’s more moaning in Room 101, we solve another refereeing case in court and we ask the big question in the community right now.. Why are the FPL Content Creators performing so badly? All this with the help of and FPL Content Creator who almost never performs badly.. FPL Harry & bringing some balance and potential team leaks to proceedings.. FPL Savage too!
