      <guid isPermaLink="false">4fa5bd83-60d9-46b7-92ce-168d02ad8a40</guid>
      <title>FPL 24/25 Player Prices Announced!</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>FPL 24/25 PLAYER PRiCES ANNOUNCED! | iSAK A STEAL? | PALMER MORE EXPENSiVE THAN FODEN & SAKA FT. SOMEONE PROBS 
<p>Now that the shit-show which is the England men’s team is now over and the heartbreak of every single tournament has been relieved once more, we can turn our attention back to a proper game… Fantasy Premier League! Some of the prices have now been released by FPL Towers so it’s up to us, the knowledge college and super-FPL think-tank.. And Nick, to pick apart the prices, find the value and discard the far too-dear with your help, of course. We slate Southgate for a bit, crown our Euro’s mini-league winner and finish up with some closing bars!</p>
<p>SPONSORS ⭐ | MERCH 🔥 | SOCiALS ✅ | - https://linktr.ee/thefpljuiceshow</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
