      <title>GW38, Crowning Champions - Featuring FPL Editor, FPL Lucky and FPL Savage</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Look mom, we made it! It’s the final show of the season and you guessed it.. Nick’s bailed yet again. He’s less reliable than a Range Rover’s security system 😅 In any case, Ash is here to bring the fun alongside PUNDiTS Tom and Daryl as we see what’s really good with our teams and assess some spicy options for the final GW! ⚽ We have more random ramblings in that special room, Guess The Player is back, we unpack more of the weeks sporting stories and we get the latest update from the best mini league in the world! 🌍 All this whilst joined for the first time by head writer for Fantasy Football Fix.. Craig aka the Editor 😉 Get on ittt! 
