      <title>Ha ha Haaland DGW37 featuring @PlanetFPL and a Semi</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The end of the season is within range and for some, it’s not coming soon enough.. Ahem, Ash! 👀 However, there is still time to change our fortunes and who better to provide the assist than James and Suj from Planet FPL! 🌍 We review our teams performances, take a look at some proper diffs in the Thermo and take a look at some of the week's biggest talking points! ⚽ There’s more angry antics in Room 101 and we crown another Manager of the Month in the JUiCE Legends League! ⭐ Oh and Chris Woods no.1 fan is back in the studio to mispronounce even more player’s names 🤣
