      <title>Two Horse Race! FPL GW36 featuring Craig from @ManOnFPL and @TrophyFPL</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The 3 horse race becomes 2. Gvardiol does it again! And Son sneaks ahead (for now) in the battle of the captains for GW35! We’re joined by Craig from the Man On Pod, as we reach the home straight of the season. It’s crunch time in those mini leagues and bragging rights are on the line for the next 12 months. As Macauley Culkin once said in Home Alone… ‘This is it, don’t get scared now’ 😉
 
