      <title>DOUBLE GAMEWEEK 34 FPL 23/24 FT. COMEDIAN, JiM DALY! 🔥</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Title dreams in tatters for both the reds? That remains to be seen but in FPL the repercussions of those upsets hit hard. Plus, things got cold 🥶 in West London 👀</p>
<p> </p>
<p>SiGNED FOOTBALL SHiRTS 👕 https://www.instagram.com/signedfshirts/?igshid=MzRlODBiNWFlZA%3D%3D </p>
<p> </p>
<p>👇 BECOME CHANNEL MEMBER 🧡 https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3OZ_37l-WOMjW_K6I0ZbTw/join</p>
<p> </p>
<p>MERCHANDiSE 🔥 | ALL SOCiALS ✅ https://linktr.ee/thefpljuiceshow </p>
<p> </p>
<p>Show Running Order:</p>
<p>Intro</p>
<p>Room 101</p>
<p>Tuesday Social </p>
<p>Team Reveals (Ash, Nick)</p>
<p>Thermo-Meter</p>
<p>Juicy Guest - (Jim Daly)</p>
<p>Legends League - Sponsored by Signed Football Shirts</p>
<p>Rate or Slate</p>
<p>Outro</p>
<p> </p>
<p>iNTRODUCTiON</p>
<p>Nick: Welcome back to the FPL JUiCE Show, your place to come for the latest squeeze of all the juicy bits from our favourite game, and yours.. Fantasy Premier League! </p>
<p><br /></p>
<p>Ash: And he’s Nick! And coming up on tonight’s show we’ll be kicking things off with a Tuesday Social where we’ll be looking at the hot topics in the world of Football and FPL!</p>
<p><br /></p>
<p>Nick: then we’ll be taking a look at how we got on in GW33 after title dreams were derailed things got cold!</p>
<p><br /></p>
<p>Ash: Then the Thermo-Meter is back! We’ll be checking out some banging options for your teams over the next couple of weeks!</p>
<p><br /></p>
<p>NiCK: plus there’ll be the usual guess the player, room 101, legends league update and we’ll be rating and slating your fh34 teams! Plus dissecting all the amazing comments on the livestream!</p>
<p><br /></p>
<p>ASH: but before all of that, please welcome a very special guest! Comedian, actor, Crystal Palace fan, legend, yes it’s Jim Daly!</p>
<p><br /></p>
<p>Nick: And Rey’s here too!</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
