      <itunes:summary>Fallen out of love with your FPL team? Don’t worry.. We’ve got just the thing you need; The return of Aaron &amp; Aimee from the now nostalgic FPL Plonker Podcast!  We’ll be tracing our steps to see how things went last week and gearing up for 33 and even further ahead to that double in 34  We’ve got plenty to cover in the Social as well as some more juicy difs in the Thermo (there may also be some curveballs this week!)  More fun shenanigans in Room 101, Guess The Player (we hope) and a little game to test our couples knowledge.. Yes, Ash &amp; Nick are also a couple 
 
