      <title>FPL Challenge and The Return of GW30 Featuring @NathanCatonComedian &amp; FPL Cim</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The International Break is almost over, as is most of your FPL seasons.. But we won’t marinade on that too long 😆 We’re back with a banger as we welcome back to the show the hilarious and wonderfully talented comedian Nathan Caton to talk all things Brentford 🐝 There’s loads to discuss in a Tuesday Social that we had to divide into 2 parts! Theres more Guess The Player and we’ll be grinding some gears in Room 101 👌 Fuck knows what our teams look like tbh so we’ll look at those and we’re joined by FPL Cim as we dissect the game mode.. FPL Challenge. Mad ting 🔥
<p>Oh and we did a thing this weekend.</p>
