      <description><![CDATA[<p><strong>So, how did the blank work out for you? That bad, huh? Well don’t worry, you can grieve with us here as we try to beat each others low scores whilst at the same time planning what to do for GW27!  We rank more of your chose ballers spice-levels and discuss more of the weeks hot topics at length!  There’s plenty of stuff which pisses us off in Room 101, we see GTP come back and we crown the winner of February's MotM!  All this while being joined by a panel of 2 content creators and one non-creator.. See if you can guess which ones which?? I’ll give you a clue on the non-content.. It’s Tom </strong></p>
