      <title>Blank Gameweek 26 FPL 23/24 Featuring @FPLFocal &amp; @TrophyFPL</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Nicks off buying the third of his super-yachts so it’s once again down to Ash to bring you the JUiCE! He’s joined by one of the biggest names in the game FPL Focal, to unpack a disappointing DGW25 for most as well as gearing up for the blank in 26! ⚽ We sauce up the place as we rank some naughty little punts for next gameweek and we learn whose smashing it in our Legends Leagues! 💪 There’s more pet peeves in the Room of 101’s and some more topical discussion in Tuesday Social with the help of BLG aka Trophy FPL Mo. Like & Subscribe, init 👌
