    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">f8ac91ba-242b-4f55-9533-c33bab35ff6c</guid>
      <title>GAMEWEEK 22 FPL 23/24 Featuring @TotalSteveO From @EliteFPL @TrophyFPL</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Weird timing! This show comes right after the GW22 deadline so it’s kind of hard to plan for GW23 when no football has been played.. Good thing we’re not an informative show aye!? 🤪 Talking nonsense this week is Ash, Nick, Mo and special Guest Steve-O covering a range of topics.. How long will it be this week before we talk FPL? Get your guesses in early! 😅 There’ll be a few players up for discussion, we reveal what our teams are for 22 and look ahead to 23 and we check out some clips from the world of TikTok.. (For Nick, TikTok is a social media platform for videos 👍😁)
<p>SiGNED FOOTBALL SHiRTS 👕 https://www.instagram.com/signedfshirts/?igshid=MzRlODBiNWFlZA%3D%3D</p>
