      <itunes:duration>02:55:26</itunes:duration>
      <itunes:summary>The longest gameweek in history is finally over and it&apos;s time for us to either lick our wounds or celebrate our team&apos;s performances before planning for what’s to come in GW22!   We get busy with the sauce ranking some players in the Thermo-Meter, there’s more Room 101, Guess The Player and we discuss ‘dark arts’ of football after Toney tactics  All this plus loads more as we’re joined by podcasting legend Tom from Who Got The Assit and Lucky Tom pops his head up from under the desk for a change! 
 
