    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">dab11c26-5fdb-4e6d-b0dd-478f303e1e8b</guid>
      <title>FPL GW21 feat @FPLBlackBox , @FPLNima from @NetThatHaulFPL and @TotalSteveO from @EliteFPL</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>WHAT A BANGER! With Cup action coming to a close and a change in deadline, it’s time we got our teams back in gear and ready to roll into 2024 with a bang! We take a look at our bus teams and analyse some of the best Salah and Son replacements! 🔥  Of course we’ve got all the fun stuff too.. Room 101, Guess The Player, some Tuesday Social and we crown the winner of December’s Manager of the Month in the JUiCE Legends League! 🏆 All this whilst being joined by 3 absolute beats of the FPL Community. It’s the one you’ve been waiting for! 💪 Sit back and relax.. This is gonna be a long one! 😂
