      <title>GAMEWEEK 18 FPL 23/24 FT. FPL CiM &amp; FPL LUCKY</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><strong>It’s our last live-show before Christmas so we had to make it a good one! We cover off our GW17 team scores and look ahead to the blank in GW18 with TikTok sensation FPL Cim with us in the studio!  We take a look at some naughty little players who would make the perfect Christmas gift and reveal whose top of the tree in our Legends League standings!  Of course we’ve got all the fun stuff.. Room 101, Guess The Player and we see the return of fan favourite.. Punditry! Merry Christmas! </strong></p>
