      <description><![CDATA[<p>Another mental Gameweek! Contentious decisions, injuries, benchings, captain fails and even a Kai Havertz goal?! We’ll be talking it all through with Joe from Fantasy Football Scout and deciding where to go from here! We’ll also be joined by the Semi Casual himself, Rupert! Room 101, Thermo-meter, Guess the Player and a fun quiz! </p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
