      <title>Gamweek 13 FPL 23/24 FT. Big Man Bakar &amp; @TrophyFPL</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The International Break is over, as are most of our FPL seasons.. But it won’t stop us from trying still! 😂 We’re joined by one of the biggest names in FPL, Big Man Bakar as we prepare for Gameweek 13, with a few players returning injured, we’ve got lots to discuss! ⚽ We’ll also be telling all you lucky pluckers how to join our 2nd Chance Members League where you can win prizes for the rest of the season! 💥 Trophy FPL aka Bottom Left Guy is back on PUNDiT duty as we talk about what football rule changes you would make 🔥 All this plus the usual banter and chat that doesn’t get recognised by the FCA’s 😉
