    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">4bb028ca-9da0-4e80-b6a0-49f078db192b</guid>
      <title>GAMEWEEK 12 FPL 23/24 FT. Sam from @FPLFamily  &amp; Semi-Casual! ⚽</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Well that wasn’t great was it!? We re-live (reluctantly) our dreadful Gameweek 11 scores and discuss our teams awful scores whilst also looking forward to what we can change for Gameweek 12! ⚽ We rank some juicy differentials on the Thermo-Meter and discuss some of the weekends biggest talking points.. Expect VAR chat here! 📺 Plenty more fun with Room 101, we’ve got some Guess The Player and a Quick Quiz to get involved with! 🔥 All this whilst being joined by the wonderful Sam Bonfield on debut and the return of the Semi.. 😉
