    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">db3d0f55-1a8f-4b7a-bc8c-80ca4905c922</guid>
      <title>GAMEWEEK 4 FPL 23/24 FT. SHAM (2GUYS 1CUP), HiNDU MONKEY &amp; FPLUCKYFPLUCKER</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><strong>We’re back with another banger of a show where we discuss the fallout of GW3 and look ahead to those plans for GW4!  We take a deeper look into some of the stars of the last gameweek and if they’re worth bringing into our teams so close to the international break!  We also announce the winner of August’s Manager of the Month from the Legends League and the amazing prizes they’ll be taking home!  All this plus we’re joined by Tom on PUNDiT duties once more, by Team South’s Number 1, Sham and the notorious Hindu Monkey is with us remotely! </strong></p>
<p> </p>
<p><strong> BECOME CHANNEL MEMBER  </strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3OZ_37l-WOMjW_K6I0ZbTw/join" target="_blank"><strong>https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3OZ_37l-WOMjW_K6I0ZbTw/join</strong></a></p>
<p> </p>
