    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">91b03cbf-3efa-433b-8e64-b333db3d7530</guid>
      <title>FPL Pre-Season 2 Featuring FPL Focal FPL OF THE DAY and FPL Juice MVP Luca</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>We kick off the pre-season on typical JUiCE fashion as we welcome back the one and only <a href="https://studio.youtube.com/channel/UC72QokPHXQ9r98ROfNZmaDw"> @FPLFocal </a> into the studio along with super pundit <a href="https://studio.youtube.com/channel/UC2sPrvR390mueq2yeDssSDg"> @FPLOFTHEDAY </a>  and of course Ash's mentor and Nick's Kid Luca. Everyone’s been tinkering with their start of season drafts and we’re absolutely no different as we show you all of ours before analysing some of the best early season fixtures to target! 🔥 We tell you about our SENSATiONAL PRiZE LEAGUE for members where you can get your hands on a Playstation 5 🎮 Plus we Rate or Slate YOUR drafts live on air! Don’t miss it.. Tell everybody! 😁
<p>BECOME CHANNEL MEMBER 🧡 https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3OZ_37l-WOMjW_K6I0ZbTw/join</p>
