      <guid isPermaLink="false">201b356b-dd2f-49cd-88ed-781f62d559c9</guid>
      <title>FPL 23/24 PRE-SEASON BEGiNS! FT. PRAS &amp; NEW PUNDiT REVEAL!</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>We kick off the pre-season on typical JUiCE fashion as we welcome back the one and only Pras into the studio along with a brand spanking new PUNDiT 👀 Everyone’s been tinkering with their start of season drafts and we’re absolutely no different as we show you all of ours before analysing some of the best early season fixtures to target! 🔥 We tell you about our SENSATiONAL NEW PRiZE LEAGUE for members where you can get your hands on a Playstation 5 🎮 Plus we Rate or Slate YOUR drafts live on air! Don’t miss it.. Tell everybody! 😁
