      <title>FPL JUiCE Off-Season feat. FPL Gunz - Ali, Winner of FPL 22/23!</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Nick and Ash are joined by the winner of FPL 22/23 season, Ali aka FPL Gunz! They chat to him about his incredible season and ask your questions from the chat. Then we will be chatting all things GW39 and the amazing charity match for streetchild which has now raised well over £7,000! Plus we catch up with the FPL JUiCE Mini league winner, Mark! It’s going to be a fun one!</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
