      <title>GAMEWEEK 26 FT. TROPHY FPL &amp; FPL FAMiLY (LEE)</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Nick’s been given special dispensation to have the week off due to a combination of poor FPL performances and a hair system failure so in steps the saviour of the show, Trophy FPL Mo as we review the current GW25 and look ahead at what GW26 has to offer! We’re ranking the hotness of some FPL assets (doing the hard work for you), The Agent has an actual good differential for once (we hope) and we’re investigating some potential fraudsters with the help of the wonderful Lee from FPL Family!</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
