      <description><![CDATA[<p>This double Gameweek isn’t even over and there’s another one fast approaching on the horizon! To help us all navigate through it, Ash & Nick are joined by resident PUNDiTS The FPL Graduates and special guest, John Nellis! We take a look at the best FPL assets for the upcoming fixtures in ‘Shopping Hit-list, we get another JUiCY Differential from The Agent and we play the famous quiz.. What’s my age again!? All this plus loads more. Keep it locked.</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
