    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">77213992-be98-4b59-b0a0-233bb53d7796</guid>
      <title>Daily Juice - Nick&apos;s too posh to write titles, Andrew Tate and the state of Man City&apos;s Finances</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Hey guys, welcome back to another FPL Juice Show, daily Juice podcast. Hope you guys are all doing well. Hope your arrows are green. So far this week. Still obviously that Man United versus leads game to come, which is gonna be very, very interesting, that will be on Wednesday night. So we're recording the FPL Juice Show.  Tomorrow is Tuesdays, as always. Make sure you join us with that well, we'll try and keep hopes alive for a, an extra green arrow, but a lot of people, Rashford Triple Captaincy has paid off this week myself. Played the Wild card. So as famously proven in last week's show, could not hit the Triple Captain. Join this channel to get access to exclusive member onlly perks: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3OZ_37l-WOMjW_K6I0ZbTw/join  Welcome back to another episode of FPL JUiCE, your place for all the juicy bits from our favourite game, and yours, The Fantasy Premier League..</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Mon, 6 Feb 2023 23:31:59 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>edit@launchpodstudios.com (FPL JUiCE)</author>
      <link>http://www.fpljuice.com</link>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Hey guys, welcome back to another FPL Juice Show, daily Juice podcast. Hope you guys are all doing well. Hope your arrows are green. So far this week. Still obviously that Man United versus leads game to come, which is gonna be very, very interesting, that will be on Wednesday night. So we're recording the FPL Juice Show.  Tomorrow is Tuesdays, as always. Make sure you join us with that well, we'll try and keep hopes alive for a, an extra green arrow, but a lot of people, Rashford Triple Captaincy has paid off this week myself. Played the Wild card. So as famously proven in last week's show, could not hit the Triple Captain. Join this channel to get access to exclusive member onlly perks: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3OZ_37l-WOMjW_K6I0ZbTw/join  Welcome back to another episode of FPL JUiCE, your place for all the juicy bits from our favourite game, and yours, The Fantasy Premier League..</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></content:encoded>
