    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">c5884995-74eb-4a40-ac9c-9899bdf80a0c</guid>
      <title>GAMEWEEK 21 FPL 22/23 FT. FPL YELLOW ARMY &amp; TROPHY FPL</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The boys are back in town ahead of Gameweek 21 and they’re joined by their number one fan and unfortunate hornet, FPL Yellow Army along with veteran PUNDiT Trophy FPL. A mid-gameweek review of DGW20 is something Nick is not looking forward to. They go shopping for the best players for GW21 (some refunds will be here too!) The Agent may pop in if he feels like it and we discuss some potential fraudsters. All this plus the normal fun shit you guys say you love.</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Jan 2023 21:25:57 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>edit@launchpodstudios.com (FPL JUiCE)</author>
      <link>http://www.fpljuice.com</link>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The boys are back in town ahead of Gameweek 21 and they’re joined by their number one fan and unfortunate hornet, FPL Yellow Army along with veteran PUNDiT Trophy FPL. A mid-gameweek review of DGW20 is something Nick is not looking forward to. They go shopping for the best players for GW21 (some refunds will be here too!) The Agent may pop in if he feels like it and we discuss some potential fraudsters. All this plus the normal fun shit you guys say you love.</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></content:encoded>
