    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">75e8e718-9b92-422b-ae34-17bf2ba88b30</guid>
      <title>GAMEWEEK 16 FPL 22/23 FT. PRAS &amp; FPL PLONKER</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Nick loses to Ash again in Gameweek 15. Ash probably alludes to this at some point. Nick will cry about the FPL website crashing yet again, most likely blames that on his poor performance. FPL Plonker brings some swagger to the place and reports on latest beef in the community. Pras shows us all how to get a top 10k rank (apart from Ash and Plonker as they already have one). Discussing best players for Gameweek 16, some pixelated fella with a differential and some other fun stuff that you won’t subscribe for!  Also Focal told us to include words like GW16 wild card, FPL Captain pick, FPL Wildcard and other excellent FPL Community related words. The algorithm loves it as much as it hates the show.</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
