      <description><![CDATA[<p>Nick returns from his sun lounger to join Ash in the studio alongside the wonderful Az from Fantasy Football Scout and Trophy FPL Mo to review GW6 and discuss GW7 plans! We also cast our eye over the best players for a Wildcard using the Thermo-Meter and FPL Plonker reports on the lastest beef within the FPL Community! There's some Guess The Player fun too and the theme for Pun'ditry this week was Occupations! Can someone call me an Allan Saint-Taximan!?</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
