      <title>GW5 FPL 22/23 FT. ABOVE AVERAGE FPL, FPL PENGUiN &amp; FPL PLONKER</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Whilst Ash waits for Nick to finish being fed grapes whilst laying on a sunbed there's a show to be had! Ash is joined in the studio by FPL Plonker for his debut pundit appearance as they discuss some of the newest PL signings and review what was a high-scoring GW4. We have team news from the fast approaching GW5 and we ask what is your fave PL goal celebration! We're also joined by two amazing guests, Adam from Above Average FPL and the imperial FPL Penguin for some chat and Guess The Player fun! Oh and there's some Cocktail Pun'ditry thrown in for good measure.. Get it? Measure.. Nevermind!</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
