      <description><![CDATA[<p>Ash & Nick are joined in the studio by FPL mammoths and all around top blokes, James & Suj from Planet FPL! We review our teams GW1 performances and talk plans for GW2. Lots of Haaland, Son, KDB and Jesus talk as you would expect! We also take a look at those knee-jerk players and rank them on the Thermo-Meter! There's some Guess The Player (kind of), The Agent drops by and Ash hosts a little round the world quiz! Pizza Pun'ditry too.. Get a slice of this down ya!</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
