    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">b15fb2d5-1928-4e7b-837c-02c4f7ebc1c5</guid>
      <title>FPL 22/23 PRE-SEASON 2 FT. FPL FELLA &amp; FEST ED!</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The sun is shining like a mofo so we thought we'd shine a light on some FPL essentials and traps, with FPL Fella as we rank players on the Thermo-Meter! We take a look at Fellas latest FPL Draft whilst also getting hot and steamy with your best 'Heatwave' puns! Fantasy Ed joins us to tell you all about Fantasy Football Fest and how you all need to come, there's some Guess The Player action and of course, we rate or slate those FPL Drafts and answer your best questions!</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 19 Jul 2022 19:27:16 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>edit@launchpodstudios.com (FPL JUiCE)</author>
      <link>http://www.fpljuice.com</link>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The sun is shining like a mofo so we thought we'd shine a light on some FPL essentials and traps, with FPL Fella as we rank players on the Thermo-Meter! We take a look at Fellas latest FPL Draft whilst also getting hot and steamy with your best 'Heatwave' puns! Fantasy Ed joins us to tell you all about Fantasy Football Fest and how you all need to come, there's some Guess The Player action and of course, we rate or slate those FPL Drafts and answer your best questions!</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></content:encoded>
