      <title>FPL JUiCE LiVE GW35</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><br /></p><p>Ash & Nick are joined into studio for returning guest, Capital FM DJ and FPL lover FPL OF THE DAY for another spicy show! Reviewing our teams and planning for the GWs ahead, discussing Jay's journey with some Guess The Player thrown in for good measure! The Agent delivers another hot tip and we revisit Ash Meets World and Nick N Da Hood! We also rate the best players for the Run-In using the controversial Thermo-Meter and we have some faith with a George Michael themed Pun'ditry competition! Enjoy!</p><br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
