    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">6255e5e7ccddaf001243b288</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE LiVE GW33</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Ash & Nick return along with Watford fan and avid FPL Manager FPL Yellow Army in the studio to mix banter and pleasure as they review GW32 whilst taking a fresh look at their options for the Double in 33! The Agent stops by (for a change) with another Juicy tip for your teams and another restaurant gets the call up as they seek some professional advice! They rank the best options for DGW33 on the Thermo-Meter (we'll call it that until there's a better name!) All this, plus Roberto has another go at Guess The Player and of course there's some more Pun'ditry where the theme is Michael Jackson! He-hee, chamon!</p><p><br /></p><br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
