      <title>FPL JUiCE LiVE GW32</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Ash and Nick are joined in the studio by the highly ranked and insightful FPL Nima as we take a look at our GW32 highs and lows whilst also building up plans for the upcoming GW32! Nima takes on the Guess The Player challenge whilst we also name our favourite 6 players to enter the Premier League Hall of Fame! There's a funny yet frustrating Call The Shots and of course there's another Pun'ditry competition where the theme this week was Watches! Don't waste any time and hit that like button! Enjoy!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
