    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-10038295</guid>
      <title>GW24 - Steve Spruce</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Ash &amp; Nick are joined by the joke-king himself Benny Blanco for a look at how our teams are shaping up ahead of this crazy part of the season with some Guess the Player action! We take an in-depth look at the doubles and blanks coming up and which players to target! We play another round of Call The Shots, tip our hats to the 2 Manager of the Months for April plus there's a Tree-themed Pun'ditry competition! No cats were harmed during the making of this FPL show!<br /><br />@Benny_Blanco40<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
