    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-9994261</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE - FRANK ROBBERY</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Ash &amp; Nick are reunited once again in the studio as they take you through to GW24! We reveal our teams and plans for the upcoming fixtures whilst giving a detailed overview of the January Transfer window in Topical JUiCE! We're joined by Newcastle fan and FPL ledge Matt aka Leafy Dragon to discuss the moneybags Toon side plus The Agent drops by for another top juicy tip! We prank call a restaurant in Tottenham asking about Dele Allis chances at Everton and of course, there's another round of Pun'ditry where the theme is Police! Check it out!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
