    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-9909300</guid>
      <title>GW23 - CRISPiANO RONAL-DORiTOS</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Whilst Nick takes a break to go and top up his tan, the one and only FPL Bhuna steps in to join Ash for a midweek review of DGW22 whilst attempting to put into place a plan for GW23! The Agent drops by with another juicy tip and we discuss if FPL this season is more luck or skill?? We're joined for a chat and some Guess The Player action by master cartoonist FPL Doodles and Bhuna casts his expert eye over some differentials rating them on our Hot/Not meter! Oh and there's some crisps Pun'ditry.. You don't wanna 'Skipps' this!<br /><br />@FPLBhuna<br />@fpldoodles1<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
