    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-9869862</guid>
      <title>DGW22 - TONY MADAGASCARiNO</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>In this show, Ash &amp; Nick do the whole remote thing where they're joined by FPL royalty in the form of Gianni Buttice! We discuss DGW22 options, tactics and strategy whilst also catching up on everything FF Fest! The Agent pops by once more with a juicy tip, there's some topical chat about the mighty Villa - Coutinho, Digne - where we're joined by FPLStevo and there's an impromptu quiz for Ash about African countries (yes, this can only end badly). All this plus some Africa-themed Pun'ditry.. It's Ghana be a banger!<br /><br />@GianniButtice<br />@FPLStevo<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 11 Jan 2022 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>edit@launchpodstudios.com (FPL JUiCE)</author>
      <link>http://www.fpljuice.com</link>
