    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-9831606</guid>
      <title>DGW21 - SHREDDiES SHERiNGHAM FT. FPL BHUNA</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><br />It's a new year but it's the same old JUiCE! In this show Ash is joined in the studio by the injection king, FPL Bhuna whilst Nick Zooms in to make it 3 of a kind! Awesome show featuring a full review of the ongoing DGW21, discussing if Lukaku is world-class and giving you an idiot's guide to AFCON! There's some Cereal Pun'ditry, Bhuna tries his luck at Guess The Player and there's a cheeky round of Call The Shots! If you like it, subscribe, if you don't.. Well.. Just subscribe anyway!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 4 Jan 2022 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>edit@launchpodstudios.com (FPL JUiCE)</author>
      <link>http://www.fpljuice.com</link>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><br />It's a new year but it's the same old JUiCE! In this show Ash is joined in the studio by the injection king, FPL Bhuna whilst Nick Zooms in to make it 3 of a kind! Awesome show featuring a full review of the ongoing DGW21, discussing if Lukaku is world-class and giving you an idiot's guide to AFCON! There's some Cereal Pun'ditry, Bhuna tries his luck at Guess The Player and there's a cheeky round of Call The Shots! If you like it, subscribe, if you don't.. Well.. Just subscribe anyway!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></content:encoded>
