    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-9763659</guid>
      <title>FPL GW19 - Giggs in Blankets</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Nick's playing with himself at a kids panto so we drafted the next best thing to come out of Watford since the Peri Chicken Shop on Vicarage Road.. Roberto Hollis who Guest Hosts the show with Juicy veteran Ash. Reviewing GW18 and looking forward to GW19 we discuss the best way to navigate the uncertain fixture list. We offer some tips for this Covid filled season discussing what the pandemic has done to our beautiful game and there is a Watford-based quiz to test our buzzy hornet. Oh and there's some Christmas Grub-themed Pun'ditry to play.. Enjoy and see you in 2 weeks! Merry Christmas!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
