    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-9721009</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE LiVE GW17</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Ash &amp; Nick begin the festivities with a Christmas Song Pun'ditry before diving straight in for a Merry GW16 Review. They analyse their options ahead of the already started GW17 deadline whilst also assessing the best Christmas Differentials! The Agent drops off his tip for the week and one of our very own day one watchers, joins us for a round of Guess The Player! It's a banger. Check it out!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
