      <description><![CDATA[<p>The JUiCE Boys are joined in the studio by the lads from FPL Graduates for some more FPL fun, chat and debate whilst also taking the piss out of Ash's Overall Rank throughout! There's a review of GW9, a look ahead to GW10. Josh pushes the WiLDCARD button and there's some tense rounds of 'Guess The Player'. The Agent drops by with another tasty tip, we discuss some FPL Community news and we have a good old catch up with our amazing guests, not to mention a 'Back 2 Skool' themed Pun'ditry! Don't bunk off this one!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
