      <title>JUiCE BAR GW8</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The JUiCE boys are back for some laid-back, late evening chat and are joined by resident JUiCERs from Newcastle, Everton and Liverpool where there's lots to catch up on! We talk money, money, money with the Newcastle takeover now complete, big budget defender options, Lukaku v Ronaldo and Rey our Arsenal drops in as he stumbles home from his date with Mo! Enjoy! <br /><br />Twitter:<br />Newcastle - @Leafy_Dragon<br />Everton - @EvertonJuicer<br />Liverpool - @TrophyFPL<br />Arsenal - @rey_qur<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
