      <title>FPL JUiCE GW8 Feat FPLSurgery - Wildcard Teams Rated or Slated</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Ash &amp; Nick go LiVE once more as they serve up another tasty treat of FPL juiciness! They preview the upcoming Gameweek 8 analysing their teams chances, there's another Rate or Slate of your Wildcard teams and we play another round of Call The Shots looking for some Captaincy advice! We're joined by another amazing guest this time in the form of Dave and Rich from FPL Surgery Podcast talking all things FPL with some belly aching banter and of cours, we play another round of Pun'ditry where the theme this week is Technology! Hope you're switched on for this one!<br /><br />JUiCY GUEST<br />@FPLSurgery - Twitter<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
