      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-9286285</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE Round Up Show! Tips &amp; Tricks to Pimp your GW7 TEAM</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Jay is back with another instalment of the FPL JUiCE Round Up Show!<br /><br />This week Jay runs us through his GW6 &amp; GW7 Teams, his 3 must have assets for GW7. We discuss is it time for Ronaldo to go and Lukaku to shine? Jay is joined for a Wildcard Dissection with Roberto our Watford JUiCER and we get the inside scoop on Jamie Vardy from FPL Foxy.<br /><br />All this plus a special appearance from the agent and a little bit more.<br /><br />Join this channel to get access to exclusive member onlly perks:<br />https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3OZ_37l-WOMjW_K6I0ZbTw/join<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 30 Sep 2021 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>edit@launchpodstudios.com (FPL JUiCE)</author>
      <link>http://www.fpljuice.com</link>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Jay is back with another instalment of the FPL JUiCE Round Up Show!<br /><br />This week Jay runs us through his GW6 &amp; GW7 Teams, his 3 must have assets for GW7. We discuss is it time for Ronaldo to go and Lukaku to shine? Jay is joined for a Wildcard Dissection with Roberto our Watford JUiCER and we get the inside scoop on Jamie Vardy from FPL Foxy.<br /><br />All this plus a special appearance from the agent and a little bit more.<br /><br />Join this channel to get access to exclusive member onlly perks:<br />https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3OZ_37l-WOMjW_K6I0ZbTw/join<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></content:encoded>
