    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-9276585</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE LiVE! - FPL GW7 feat Andy from @Let&apos;s Talk FPL ​</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Ash has ran out of petrol and Nick has run out of the will to use a barbers. Its all banter and love in another episode of the FPL circus that is FPL JUiCE LiVE! We talk GW6 highs and lows whilst turning attention to GW7 and some Captaincy decisions to make! We review the most transferred in and out players and discuss why and is it worth it? We take a look at what's popping in the FPL Community and of course there's another edition of Pun'ditry where the theme is The Circus! But we're most excited about the main man, Andy from Let's Talk FPL joining us for a little chat about FPL, his fledgling career as a YouTuber and of course a whole lotta fun and laughs! Check it out, like and sub if you want too!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
