      <title>FPL GW5 - SYLVAiN KiLT-ORD</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Back juicier than ever! Ash &amp; Nick take you through a review of their GW4 performances whilst looking ahead to GW5. We have a juicy guest in the form of FPL Eire where we chat all things FPL and play another round of 'Guess The Player'. We take a look at which players are being jumped on in 'All Aboard!', we get some Captaincy advice from a restaurant in 'Call The Shots!' and there's a tasty differential pick from 'The Agent'. All this plus we answer your Juicy questions and we 'roll up the sleeves' with another Pun'ditry competition! Suit up! Like and Subscribe!<br /><br />JUiCY Guest - @FPL_Eire (Twitter)<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
