      <title>JUiCE BAR - GW5</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Come and join another fantastic round at the bar where Ash &amp; Nick are joined by JUiCERs from Newcastle, Palace, Watford and Everton! We play a round of 'Guess The Player' with the guys and of course there is plenty of FPL Chat. Is Gallagher essential? Is Gray a trap? Is ASM an option? Who's the best captain? All these questions and more are answered.. And you may have some laughs along the way! Like and Subscribe!<br /><br />Twitter<br />@LeafyDragon_FPL - Newcastle United <br />@FPL_EZE - Crystal Palace<br />@RobertoHollis9 - Watford <br />@EvertonJuicer - Everton<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
