      <title>FPL GW4 - DAMiEN DUFFMAN</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Ash and Nick host another banger of a show filled with laughs on draught. Speaking of laughs, we're joined by Comedian, writer and Brentford fan, Nathan Caton for a juicy chat about all things Brentford, comedy and of course.. FPL! We talk a look at what's happening with our GW4 teams whilst The Agent drops by once more for another player pick! We interview our August Manager of the Month, Joe (Current OR=216) and of course, there's another Pun'ditry competition where the theme this week was The Simpsons! Check it out.. D'oh!!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
