    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-9081616</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE - GW3 - GiANFRANCO GORGON-ZOLA</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Join the JUiCE lads as they wade their way through GW2 with very differing scores whilst looking ahead to GW3. The Agent comes out of hibernation to provide you with a juicy diffential pick. We're joined by FPL Twitter royalty with FPL Linn for a chat and a new game we've called 'Guess Who?' We've got some ACTUAL FPL STATS courtesy of Fantasy Football Fix and we try and call a couple more restaurants for FPL advice in 'Call The Shots'. There's a stinky Pun'ditry competition with a cheese theme plus loads more! Check it out and don't forget to vote for us in the Football Content Awards! We're nominated in two categories (Best Podcast and Best Video) somehow.. Click here to vote: https://footballcontentawards.com/voting/<br /><br />@fpl_linnFPL JUiCE - GW3 - GiANFRANCO GORGON-ZOLA<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
