      <description><![CDATA[<p>Join Ash and Special Guest Host Jay as we bring you another serving of freshly squeezed FPL content! We wave our wands in a Harry Potter themed Pun'ditry Conpetition whilst Dr Ash &amp; Professor Jay Fix Your FPL Squads with their expert advice! We're joined by Special Guest, Matt Whelan, author of the book FPL Obsessed for a brilliant chat plus we test Jay's knowledge of all the Jay, Jamie's and James' in FPL! There's a Roast or Toast of Nick's FPL Draft and we have a juicy stat (that's right, actual stats) from Fantasy Football Fix's FPL Phillips! All this and loads, loads more! EXPELLIAMUS!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
