      <title>FPL Pre-Season teams from our social channels - rated or slated in 30 seconds!</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>50 21/22 FPL Pre-Season teams from our social media channels - rated or slated in 30 seconds!<br /><br />Nick and Ash, smashing their way through some of the nightmares that you lot are beginning your 21/22 season with. With the world buzzing about the validity of experts within the FPL community we'd like to make it super clear, these two are not, nor ever painted as experts. I mean if we had to pick one it'd be Ash, but, we don't so we won't.<br /><br />Don't forget to join us live every Tuesday night with all the best banter from the world of FPL.<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
