    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-8821514</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE SUMMER EDiTiON S1E7 - ARMANi BLUE JENUS</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Join Ash and Nick once more as we sneak in a tidy little podcast before the first EURO Semi Final. The boys are reunited but it's far from a love affair as the jealousy of Nick spills out onto the JUiCE desk in tremendous fashion.. Cue the banter! We take a look at our EURO Fantasy Teams and talk about England's chances. Your favourite fun feature Ash Meets World and Nick N Da Hood is back once again whilst we are joined by our Spurs and Crystal Palace JUiCERs for a catch up on all things Euros and their respective clubs! We give you guys the last number in the code you need to be in with a chance of winning a Playstation 5 and of course.. There is a Pun'ditry competition where the theme is Fragrances! Kick back, relax, crack open a juice and enjoy!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
