    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-8708227</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE SUMMER EDiTiON S1E4 - Smelly Cattermole</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The JUiCE boys are back with a bang in this slightly condensed show making room for you guys to watch FRA V GER! We have a brilliant FRIENDS-themed Pun'ditry comp and we catch up with our Arsenal and Manchester United JUiCERs for a quick chat! We conduct a review of our EURO FF Teams where we still don't know what the hell were' doing! There's another episode of Ash Meets World and Nick N Da Hood, we take a look at the EURO JUiCE League and we give you another number in the code for our Secret PS5 Giveaway! Miss it, miss out!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
