    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-8668980</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE SUMMER EDiTiON S1E3 - ROBERTO MAN-KiNi</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Yes, we're back once again bringing you those EURO Summer Footy vibes with another Juicy show for your asses! This week we're making the most of the beautiful weather with a 'The Beach' themed Pun'ditry competition! We take a look at Ash and Nicks final EURO FF teams as well as playing a fun game where Nick has to pronounce some difficult European players names! We open the JUiCE bar to you guys for a chat as well as being joined by some more of our Official JUiCERs! We've got another edition of Ash Meets World and Nick N Da Hood, we do some Euros Predictions and we give you another number in the secret code you need to unlock for your chance to win a PS5! Don't be shy and get on it!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 8 Jun 2021 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
