    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-8662676</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE SUMMER EDiTiON S1E2 - RONALDiN-YO! SUSHi</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>We're back for episode 2 of our Euros Summer Edition of FPL JUiCE! This week we get to grips with Euro Fantasy Football learning rules, tips and strategy with best in the business FPL Mate! We have another episode of Ash Meets World and Nick N Da Hood, can you get them right!? We chat with 3 of our Official JUiCERs getting their spin on their respective clubs and talking a bit of England whist we also enjoy an Ash v Nick quiz devised by OG and fan of the show FPL Noble Gent! Insults and banter aplenty in this slightly extended show! Sit back and enjoy!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
