    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-8548966</guid>
      <title>Episode 36 - TARiBO WEST SiDE STORY</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Welcome back once more to the JUiCiEST FPL Podcast in the world!<br />We get involved with some Musical Theatre themed PUNditry. We review Gameweek 36 and look at how 37 is shaping up! There’s plenty of Ash Meets World and of course, Nick N The Hood!<br />We play beer pong to decide who goes through to the PS5 giveaway semi final! All this and much, MUCH more! Don’t be Les Miserables, get involved!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
