    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-8503394</guid>
      <title>FPL. JUiCE S1E35 - STEVE McMANA-MANGANESE - PS5 Q-F BEER PONG!</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>We're back with another pouring of that juice you know and love! This week we spill over our TGW35 teams in a mid-week Review whilst turning our attention to a tricky BGW36. There's another edition of Ash Meets World where he tries to out-smart a 7-year-old and another installment of Nick N Da Hood, can he up his street slang game!? The Agent passes through with some more of that questionable wisdom and we give you the low-down on who's up and down in the JUiCE League. And of course there's another Pun'ditry Competition to get your brain 'Zinc'ing' where the theme is the Periodic Table! But the main event is indeed, that PlayStation 5 Giveaway where 16 became 8 in the most intense and emotionally charged game of Beer Pong in the history of Beer Pong! Get the beers in, relax and enjoy!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 11 May 2021 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>edit@launchpodstudios.com (FPL JUiCE)</author>
      <link>http://www.fpljuice.com</link>
