      <itunes:duration>01:19:25</itunes:duration>
      <itunes:summary>We&apos;re back with another pouring of that juice you know and love! This week we spill over our TGW35 teams in a mid-week Review whilst turning our attention to a tricky BGW36. There&apos;s another edition of Ash Meets World where he tries to out-smart a 7-year-old and another installment of Nick N Da Hood, can he up his street slang game!? The Agent passes through with some more of that questionable wisdom and we give you the low-down on who&apos;s up and down in the JUiCE League. And of course there&apos;s another Pun&apos;ditry Competition to get your brain &apos;Zinc&apos;ing&apos; where the theme is the Periodic Table! But the main event is indeed, that PlayStation 5 Giveaway where 16 became 8 in the most intense and emotionally charged game of Beer Pong in the history of Beer Pong! Get the beers in, relax and enjoy! See acast.com/privacy for privacy and opt-out information.</itunes:summary>
      <itunes:subtitle>We&apos;re back with another pouring of that juice you know and love! This week we spill over our TGW35 teams in a mid-week Review whilst turning our attention to a tricky BGW36. There&apos;s another edition of Ash Meets World where he tries to out-smart a 7-year-old and another installment of Nick N Da Hood, can he up his street slang game!? The Agent passes through with some more of that questionable wisdom and we give you the low-down on who&apos;s up and down in the JUiCE League. And of course there&apos;s another Pun&apos;ditry Competition to get your brain &apos;Zinc&apos;ing&apos; where the theme is the Periodic Table! But the main event is indeed, that PlayStation 5 Giveaway where 16 became 8 in the most intense and emotionally charged game of Beer Pong in the history of Beer Pong! Get the beers in, relax and enjoy! See acast.com/privacy for privacy and opt-out information.</itunes:subtitle>
