      <description><![CDATA[<p>Come and join us for another Juicy adventure as Ash and Nick deliver another glass of fresh FPL content! We're joined by FPL Eire for some Pokemon themed Pun'ditry, we have some Gameweek 33 Reviews and reveal our GW34 Teams! There's another edition of Ash Meets World and Nick N Da Hood whilst The Agent takes some time out of his busy schedule to bring you another tip for your squads! Oh and we open The JUiCE Bar once more for our viewers to Zoom-call into the show for a cheeky chat about all things topical! You don't wanna miss it.. Gotta catch em all!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
