      <title>FPL JUiCE S1E32 - FRiDAY NiGHT DiGNE - SUPER LEAGUE SPECIAL</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Join us for a truly Live and Interactive Podcast as Ash and Nick produce their usual show of FPL mishaps and mayhem, with a fruity twist.. We are joined by different guests throughout the show as we talk European Super League at great length! There's another episode of Ash Meets World and Nick N Da Hood, we also have The Agent drop by with another VT, we have a mid-week review of our teams and of course, there's some Pun'ditry with a Sitcom theme! We'll be there for youuuuuu!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
