    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-8333068</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE S01E31 - HEUNG MON-SOON</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Welcome back once more to the JUiCiEST FPL Podcast in town!<br />We have a guest with us this week, in friend of the show, Curt!<br />Join us as we attempt some ‘Weather’ related PUNditry, find out how Gameweek 31 was and what the plans are for Gameweek 32! Ash Meets the World once more and Nick takes a trip down to the ‘hood’. The Agent drops some more knowledge upon us and we answer all your JUiCY questions. Plus there is lots, LOTS more. Whatever happened to Fred the Weatherman? Find out the shocking truth here.<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
