    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-8285097</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE S1E30 - MAX VAR-STAPPEN</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>After 2 long weeks away, Ash has recovered from his severe case of man-flu to once again team up with the lego-haired Nick and bring you the FPL JUiCE Podcast. In this episode we review GW30 whilst Ash finally gives a Team-Reveal! There's a bit of 'Ash Meets World' and 'Nick N Da Hood' once more! The Agent stops singing for a moment to give you another Juicy tip for the upcoming Gameweek whilst we bust some more FPL Jargon. There are some very questionable Northern Irish accents at one point and what is the plural for Mongoose? Plus we have a Formula 1 themed Pun'ditry competition! You don't wanna miss this.. GO GO GO GO!! 🚦<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
