    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-8161485</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE S1E28 - PUTTER SCHMEiCHEL</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>FORE!! FPL JUiCE comes swinging back into action bringing you that special blend of laughs, banter and FPL interacting live with you.. The beautiful FPL Community! This week we review our pitiful GW28's while Ash procrastinates once more on his changes for BGW29. There's another edition of 'Ash Meets World' and 'Nick N Da Hood', we know you love it! We've got another top tip from that man, yes The Agent is back! There are some rather questionable accents being portrayed during the JUiCE League Top 10 (apologies in advance!) plus we've got Juicy Questions, the Community Team and a golf-inspired Pun'ditry Competition amongst so much else! This one's a hole in one! Get in!<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
