    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-8111032</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE - S1E27 MACHO MAN ROBBiE SAVAGE</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>IF you smeeeeeeellllllllll what the JUiCE is cookin’! We are back once more with an absolute piledriver of a show! We’ve got Wrestling themed PUNditry! We see how things are going so far in GW27 and look at the options for GW28! Ash gets to grips with some geographical ‘Ash meets world’ and Nick returns to the ghetto in ‘Nick in da Hood’! Can The Agent recover from his Bertrand Traore pick from last week? You’ll have to watch the find out! We also count down the top 10 in the JUiCE League, plus we give you those all important details on how to enter our massive PlayStation 5 Giveaway. We look at some ‘Freshly Squeezed’ options for, differential, plus answer all your JUiCY Questions! It’s a Royal Rumble show and you don’t want to get thrown over the top rope and miss it! #FPL<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
