    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-8064153</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE S1E26 - GOOFY SIGURDSSON</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Yes, we are back once more and the disorderly duo have plenty to discuss! We have Disney themed PUNditry (what could go wrong?!) We see how things are going so far in DGW26 and look at the options for GW27! Will Ash be flummoxed by another simple word? Will Nick’s ‘gangsta’ cover be blown due to his lack of urban slang? Can The Agent top his fantastic pick of Gareth Bale from last week? You’ll have to watch the find out! We also count down the top 10 in the JUiCE League, plus we give you those all important details on how to enter our massive PlayStation 5 Giveaway. All this, plus we’ll be telling you about the exciting launch of ‘FPL JUiCE’ beer! 🍺 We also have time to lose 3 of our senses while trying the world’s hottest tortilla chip! You don’t want to miss this one! #FPL<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
