    <item>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">Buzzsprout-8020221</guid>
      <title>FPL JUiCE S1E25 - ADAM LA-LLAMA</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Yes, your favourite fruity friends return with another smasher of a show where we review GW25 and discuss our options for the meaty Double GW26! Ash tries to decipher another obscure word whilst Nick channels his inner J-Hus to de-code some urban slang! The Agent returns from his furry fandom convention to deliver some more helpful advice whilst we count down the top 10 in the JUiCE League, plus we give you those all important details on how to enter our massive PlayStation 5 Giveaway. All this and we have some animal themed Pun'ditry.. You'd be barking mad not to enjoy this one!<br /><br />8:27 PUNditry Part 1<br />16:01 Gameweek 25 Reviews/ Gameweek 26 Previews<br />32:20 Ash Meets World<br />37:09 Nick N The Hood<br />40:36 Community Team<br />45:19 The Agent<br />49:16 JUiCE League/World’s hottest Gummi-Bear Challenge<br />52:06 PS5 Giveaway<br />53:05 JUiCY Questions <br />1:04:21 PUNditry Part 2<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
