      <description><![CDATA[<p>The inaugural episode of the FPL JUiCE Podcast. This one is a little longer than it will be usually, but there is a LOAD to cover, it's a cracker to kick things off!<br /><br />Ash &amp; Nick give their full Team Previews in their End to End discussion, Learn about a top differential pick from our man on the inside, ‘The Agent’, five all the info on the FPL JUiCE Mini League and Community Team,<br />Get some explanation as to why Ash is like Calvin Harris, Hear the boys rate and slate each other’s drafts, Learn about Nick’s unhealthy obsession with Michael Bolton and much more.<br /><br />Proudly recorded at, and produced by, LaunchPod Studios.<br /><br />www.launchpodstudios.com<br /><hr /><p> See <a target="_blank" href="https://acast.com/privacy">acast.com/privacy</a> for privacy and opt-out information.</p></p><br/> <p>Hosted by Simplecast, an AdsWizz company. See <a href="https://pcm.adswizz.com">pcm.adswizz.com</a> for information about our collection and use of personal data for advertising.</p>]]></description>
